                                "sense_id": "b484254d-e0ea-3fc8-a5ee-8c833c0dec4b",
                                "text": "[…] a hearing, with a file of orders in the solicitor's bundle, as big as the common-prayer-book, for commissions, injunctions, publications, speedings, delayings, and other interlocutories; all dear ware to the client in every respect."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4a7530d-0a4e-4f8e-ae13-875a95a368cb",
                                "sense_id": "b484254d-e0ea-3fc8-a5ee-8c833c0dec4b",
                                "text": "We have seen Parkinsonism as sudden starts and stops, as odd speedings and slowings."
